          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.29,
          "end": 24.06,
          "en": "And in there, I'll add a contact-form JS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.06,
          "end": 27.61,
          "en": "and attached you also find a styling file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.61,
          "end": 29.7,
          "en": "for this contact form page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.7,
          "end": 32.2,
          "en": "for this contact form component, I mean.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.2,
          "end": 35.35,
          "en": "You find a contact form module CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.35,
          "end": 37.323,
          "en": "which you should add to that folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.42,
          "end": 40.45,
          "en": "Then, in contact form JS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.45,
          "end": 44.17,
          "en": "we create our contact form functional component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.17,
          "end": 47.72,
          "en": "just as we are used to, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.72,
          "end": 50.7,
          "en": "And we can also import the styles already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.7,
          "end": 55.7,
          "en": "Import classes from ./contact-form.module.css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.12,
          "end": 62.17,
          "en": "and then return our page content here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.17,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "So return a section with a class name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 68.02,
          "en": "of \"classes.contact\" here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.02,
          "end": 70.94,
          "en": "And then in that section, let's say a H1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.94,
          "end": 73.5,
          "en": "not H2, but H1 tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.5,
          "end": 77.89,
          "en": "where we say something like, \"How can I help you?\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.89,
          "end": 81.1,
          "en": "And then below that, the actual form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.1,
          "end": 85.4,
          "en": "Now, that form will receive a class of \"form\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.4,
          "end": 89.3,
          "en": "And then in there I came up with a certain structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.3,
          "end": 92.21000000000001,
          "en": "which fits the styles I provided to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.21000000000001,
          "end": 97.21000000000001,
          "en": "where we have a div with a class of \"controls\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.46000000000001,
          "end": 100.62,
          "en": "So plural.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.62,
          "end": 104.87,
          "en": "And in there, another div with a single form control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.87,
          "end": 107.9,
          "en": "and hence a class of \"control\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.9,
          "end": 112.53999999999999,
          "en": "And then in there, a label with the htmlFor prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.53999999999999,
          "end": 116.94,
          "en": "set to \"email\", where I say, \"Your Email\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.94,
          "end": 119.9,
          "en": "because we're prompting the user for an email address.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.9,
          "end": 123.07,
          "en": "And below that, a input of type \"email\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.07,
          "end": 127.763,
          "en": "with an ID of \"email\", which is required, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.71,
          "end": 132.26,
          "en": "And then I'll replicate this control div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 132.26,
          "end": 135.04,
          "en": "inside of that controls div still.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.04,
          "end": 139.09,
          "en": "So the two control divs are side by side here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 139.09,
          "end": 141.323,
          "en": "And then here we have the name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 142.25,
          "end": 146.32,
          "en": "And we change htmlFor to \"name\" and, whoops,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.32,
          "end": 149.12,
          "en": "and the ID to \"name\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 149.12,
          "end": 153.14,
          "en": "And it's still required, but the type is set to \"text\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 153.14,
          "end": 156.97,
          "en": "And then below that controls div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 156.97,
          "end": 159.46,
          "en": "so not inside of it but below it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 159.46,
          "end": 164.46,
          "en": "I'll add another div with a class name of \"classes.control\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 164.57999999999998,
          "end": 167.27,
          "en": "so singular again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 167.27,
          "end": 172.27,
          "en": "with another label with a htmlFor prop set to \"message\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 172.32999999999998,
          "end": 175.39,
          "en": "where we say, \"Your Message\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 175.39,
          "end": 179.82999999999998,
          "en": "And below that, a text area with an ID of \"message\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 179.82999999999998,
          "end": 184.29,
          "en": "and rows set to \"5\", like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 184.29,
          "end": 187.203,
          "en": "And then below that, another div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 188.47,
          "end": 191.73,
          "en": "where I set the class to \"actions\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 191.73,
          "end": 194.35,
          "en": "where I wanna have my submit button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 194.35,
          "end": 198.28,
          "en": "So a simple button where I say, \"Send Message\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 198.28,
          "end": 199.583,
          "en": "That's my form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 201.47,
          "end": 204.18,
          "en": "Now we can use that in the contact page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 204.18,
          "end": 208.2,
          "en": "and output ContactForm like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 208.2,
          "end": 210.253,
          "en": "Make sure to import it, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 211.09,
          "end": 214.15,
          "en": "And if you save all of that and reload that contact page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 214.15,
          "end": 217.15,
          "en": "you should see that contact form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 217.15,
          "end": 219.5,
          "en": "Now, that's a basic form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 219.5,
          "end": 223.52,
          "en": "The goal now is that when we send our form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 223.52,
          "end": 226.11,
          "en": "we send it to an API route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 226.11,
          "end": 229.52,
          "en": "and then there, we store it in a database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 229.52,
          "end": 232.88,
          "en": "We don't directly talk to a database, as we learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 232.88,
          "end": 236.21,
          "en": "because if we would do so, if we would add code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 236.21,
          "end": 239.99,
          "en": "for talking to a database in the contact form component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 239.99,
          "end": 243.35,
          "en": "then we would have to put our database credentials",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 243.35,
          "end": 245.28,
          "en": "into this component as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 245.28,
          "end": 248.373,
          "en": "And we don't wanna do that for security reasons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 249.44,
          "end": 252.65,
          "en": "Hence, we'll do it the other way and add our API route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 252.65,
          "end": 256.863,
          "en": "plus the code to talk to that API route in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
